cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results it reproduces, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Computational Complexity Analysis of Quantum-Inspired Pretty Good Measurement Classifiers — code"
abstract: >-
  Implementations of the copy-dependent (c-PGM), kernelized (k-PGM) and
  symmetric-subspace-reduced (Rc-PGM) Pretty Good Measurement classifiers,
  together with the benchmark harness, the notebook and the dataset
  preparation script that reproduce the empirical section of the accompanying
  paper.
